@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #526d76

rectangle "설치된 module\n+ strategy + journal 용량" as M
rectangle "GFTA activation profile\n(예산)" as P
rectangle "검사를 거친 구조 계획 하나\n(구성, temporal arena 없음)" as SP
rectangle "보고\n(fitsBudget, 필요 용량)" as R
rectangle "Activation" as A
rectangle "Replay" as RP

M --> SP
P --> SP
SP --> R : plan_temporal /\nplan_current_temporal_replay
SP --> A : 같은 계획
SP --> RP : 같은 계획
note right of A
  할당 용량은 계획된
  구성 안에 있어야 함;
  불일치는 거부됨
end note
@enduml
